CD
==

Change directory.


BASIC
-----
cd folder

Enter a folder.


SHORTCUTS
---------
cd              Go to home
cd ~            Go to home
cd ..           Go up one level
cd ../..        Go up two levels
cd -            Go to previous directory


PATHS
-----
Absolute path:
  cd /home/user/project

Relative path:
  cd project/src


TIPS
----
Use Tab to auto-complete folder names.
Use pwd to see where you are.


ERRORS
------
"no such file"   → Folder doesn't exist
"permission"     → No access rights
